  "question": "求 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\\left[\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{4n} +\\cos \\frac{3\\pi}{4n} +\\dots +\\cos \\frac{(2n - 1)\\pi}{4n}\\right].$",
  "answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = \\frac{2}{\\pi}$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 利用三角函数的积化和差公式先“分拆”，再“缩项”."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由于"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l} x _ {n} & = \\frac {1}{n} \\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n} \\cos \\frac {(2 k - 1) \\pi}{4 n} = \\frac {1}{n \\cdot 2 \\sin \\frac {\\pi}{4 n}} \\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n} 2 \\sin \\frac {\\pi}{4 n} \\cos \\frac {(2 k - 1) \\pi}{4 n} \\\\ & = \\frac {1}{n \\cdot 2 \\sin \\frac {\\pi}{4 n}} \\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n} \\left[ \\sin \\frac {k \\pi}{2 n} - \\sin \\frac {(k - 1) \\pi}{2 n} \\right] \\\\ & = \\frac {1}{n \\cdot 2 \\sin \\frac {\\pi}{4 n}} \\left(\\sin \\frac {\\pi}{2} - \\sin 0\\right), \\end{array}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "所以 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = \\frac{2}{\\pi}$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = \\frac{2}{\\pi}$",
